Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.49,0:00:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm 99 % sure the Death\NGun story's a hoax.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.03,0:00:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably someone trolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.63,0:00:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't kill someone in the real\Nworld from the virtual anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.85,0:00:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.77,0:00:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's still that 1\N% chance it could be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.61,0:00:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.89,0:00:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Link start!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.19,0:00:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a lot different\Nthan Aincrad. Go figure.
