Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.93,0:02:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I looked a little more soldier-ish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.63,0:03:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy bazongas, that's the\NF-1300 model, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.17,0:03:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That avatar's so rare, I've\Nonly heard about them till now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.63,0:03:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you two mega\Ncredits for your account.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.89,0:03:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, lady, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.27,0:03:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.93,0:03:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to break it to you,\NGuy, but I'm a guy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.89,0:03:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.07,0:03:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that means you got the M9000 model.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.15,0:03:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you four.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.11,0:03:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, five for it. Sell it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.35,0:03:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, sell it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.55,0:03:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but this isn't a default avatar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.01,0:03:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a converted one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't exchange it for cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.09,0:03:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, that sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.19,0:03:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.41,0:03:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, if you ever change your\Nmind, give me the first bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.35,0:04:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I want to get Death Gun's attention,\NI have to make a name for myself first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.63,0:04:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you looking for some action?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.23,0:04:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you too good for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.41,0:04:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm totally lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.99,0:04:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some shortcut this turned out to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.87,0:04:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, excuse me, can you tell me where...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.37,0:04:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, she thinks I'm hitting on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.13,0:04:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.89,0:04:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your first time in the game, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.09,0:05:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.49,0:05:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, she thinks I'm a girl too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.41,0:05:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.05,0:05:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.03,0:05:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's my first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.53,0:05:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a place\Nto buy a cheap gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.31,0:05:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I also need to find out\Nwhere the governor's office is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.73,0:05:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.19,0:05:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.67,0:05:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not cool, but I'll let her keep\Nthinking I'm a girl for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.95,0:05:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, why do you want to\Ngo to the Governor's office?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.77,0:05:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I wanted to sign myself up for\Nan event called Bullet of Bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.43,0:06:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,B .O .B.?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.17,0:06:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but you just started\Nplaying today, right? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.19,0:06:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your stats may not be\Nhigh enough for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, I converted, so all my skills\Nhave been transferred from another game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.13,0:06:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.49,0:06:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So anyway, you picked a\Nheck of a game to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.61,0:06:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all grimy and stinks of oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.67,0:06:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've only played\Nfantasy games up to now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.21,0:06:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're fun, but I thought\NI'd try a cyber game for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.45,0:06:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was also interested in seeing\Nwhat gun battles were like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.91,0:06:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It takes guts to want\Nto start with B .O .B.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.81,0:06:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right off the bat like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.79,0:06:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hook you up with a gun, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.59,0:06:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this great market.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.15,0:06:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.83,0:06:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this place looks\Nlike it has everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.05,0:07:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.96,0:07:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the two types of weapons\Nthat are mostly used
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.61,0:07:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in GGO are optical guns\Nand live ammo guns. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.07,0:07:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An optical gun's lighter and more\Naccurate, but it has its drawbacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.67,0:07:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If your opponent equips their defense\Nshield, it only does half the damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.75,0:07:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a one-on-one tourney like B .O .B.,\Na live ammo gun's the best bet. Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.21,0:07:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.67,0:07:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's start with your stats.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.13,0:07:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Highest one first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.77,0:07:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I guess my strength is the highest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.97,0:07:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And speed after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.39,0:07:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're an S-T-R-A-G-I type, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.07,0:07:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you've got two choices\Nfor your main weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.87,0:07:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either a heavy assault rifle\Nor a large caliber machine gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.09,0:07:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whichever one you choose, you're also going\Nto need a handgun for a backup weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.61,0:07:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.99,0:08:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you just\Nconverted over, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.15,0:08:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any credits?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.57,0:08:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I should.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.87,0:08:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.09,0:08:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says I have a thousand credits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.77,0:08:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody gets that when they start.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.73,0:08:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.99,0:08:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.90,0:08:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's all you have, the most you can\Nafford's going to be a small ray gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.69,0:08:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for a live ammo gun, a thousand\Nwon't even get you a used revolver.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.47,0:08:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, if you want, I could\Nloan you the money to buy a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.17,0:08:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really sweet of\Nyou, but I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.57,0:08:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.81,0:08:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this game have anything in it where a
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.73,0:08:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,new player like me could\Ngo earn some money?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.21,0:08:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't recommend them, but\Nthere are casinos and gambling games.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.87,0:08:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.23,0:08:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, chicken! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.99,0:08:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you play?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.77,0:08:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You enter through that gate and go down\Nthe alley dodging the NPC's bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.01,0:09:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The idea is to get as close as you\Ncan to him without getting shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.77,0:09:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can touch him,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.27,0:09:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you win all the cash everyone's sunk\Ninto it since the last time it was beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.65,0:09:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,$300,000 change.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.01,0:09:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that is a heck of a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, no one's beating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.79,0:09:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you get eight meters\Naway from the gunslinger,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.53,0:09:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he switches to this wicked\Nfast quick-draw mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.09,0:09:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the time you see the\Nbullet lines, it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.07,0:09:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bullet lines?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, another sucker's stepping\Nup to add to the jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.03,0:09:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's the day, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.67,0:09:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.19,0:09:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna blast you from here\Nto the moon, you varmint.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.39,0:09:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch me clear this\Nbiatch and nothing flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.09,0:09:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jackpot's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.11,0:09:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.75,0:10:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why's he doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.97,0:10:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that the bullet line? Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.81,0:10:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a defensive system assist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.67,0:10:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.97,0:10:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except for a sniper's first shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.25,0:10:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bullet prediction lines always show\Nup in the target's field of vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.87,0:10:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you. Whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.53,0:10:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.44,0:10:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.29,0:10:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.79,0:10:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Game over, hoss!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.69,0:10:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that sucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.03,0:10:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy didn't have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.31,0:10:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:11:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The alley's so narrow, you can't\Nmove too far to either side,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.39,0:11:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you're forced to charge\Nthe gunslinger straight on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.39,0:11:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's about as far as anyone's gotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.85,0:11:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.91,0:11:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I wait to see the bullet\Nlines, it'll be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.33,0:11:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.43,0:11:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten Kirito says the newbie\Ngets it out of the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.41,0:11:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's the cutest\Ntarget I ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.79,0:11:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's stick around and\Nwatch her get pwned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.25,0:11:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.95,0:11:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.59,0:11:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.19,0:11:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She passed the ten meter mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.17,0:12:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is one fast kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.13,0:12:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die, you varmint.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.21,0:12:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll blast you to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.19,0:12:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like someone's out of bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.41,0:12:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nooooooooooooooooooooooooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.49,0:12:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chicken, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.85,0:12:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.55,0:12:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is that kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.45,0:13:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, I've never\Nseen reflexes like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.17,0:13:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, at the end, you dodged his\Nlasers from about two meters away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.61,0:13:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At that range, the time between you seeing\Nthe bullet lines and the shots fired,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.79,0:13:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.70,0:13:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There shouldn't have been\Nany time between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.05,0:13:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.17,0:13:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, since it's a game of dodging\Nbullets, I just predicted the bullet lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.51,0:13:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, predict the predictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.15,0:13:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:32.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you predicted the predictions?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.29,0:13:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.35,0:13:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm confused about the specs\Nfor this assault rifle. I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.51,0:13:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this thing's ginormous,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.61,0:13:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so why is the caliber of the bullets it\Nfires smaller than a submachine gun's?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.71,0:13:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm confused about how\Nsomeone like you can
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.27,0:13:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dodge bullets like a\Nghost and not know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.25,0:13:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You converted from another game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.49,0:13:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you play before this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.03,0:13:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.61,0:14:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one of those typical\Nfantasy games is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.93,0:14:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.05,0:14:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.45,0:14:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, during the B .O .B.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.05,0:14:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,prelims, I'll get an idea\Nof what you can really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.41,0:14:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for the assault rifle, you want\Nto know why it uses a small caliber?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.25,0:14:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.19,0:14:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all goes back to the M16 from the U .S.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.11,0:14:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They designed it for precision\Nand penetrative power,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.29,0:14:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but using a fast, small-caliber round.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.85,0:14:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to know that stuff, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.01,0:14:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you've got 300K, you can buy\Npretty much whatever gun you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.41,0:14:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all comes down to what you want and\Nwhat you think will work best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.57,0:14:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does work for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.91,0:14:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.89,0:14:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, those are photon swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.87,0:14:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Photon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.79,0:14:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a beam of light that's\Na wave in a particle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.85,0:15:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Photon sword's the official name,\Nbut people call them laser blades,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.43,0:15:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beam sabers, and something else\NI can't remember. Oh, cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.37,0:15:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can use a sword here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.89,0:15:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if you want, but\Nnobody really uses them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.33,0:15:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.55,0:15:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I mean, because.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.27,0:15:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't use it unless\Nyou're close to your target.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.77,0:15:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you're crazy enough to get that\Nclose, you'll get shot full of holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.01,0:15:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So basically, it's good as\Nlong as you get close enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess, but even\Nwith your skill at dodging,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.29,0:15:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if there's a full auto gun firing, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.57,0:15:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Slayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.79,0:15:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.63,0:15:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your purchase!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.39,0:15:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a nice day!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.87,0:15:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, I guess when it comes to\Ncombat, everyone's got their own style.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.73,0:15:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way I see it, if this place sells\Nsomething, it must be OK for battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.81,0:15:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.17,0:16:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.45,0:16:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, she looks like she\Nknows what she's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.13,0:16:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, those are your fantasy game skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.09,0:16:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.61,0:16:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know a couple of moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.91,0:16:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sure is light.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.51,0:16:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.59,0:16:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, looks like you're dead set\Non that for your main weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.39,0:16:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you should have a submachine gun\Nor a handgun in your inventory, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.51,0:16:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll distract your enemy\Nso you can get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.89,0:16:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.31,0:16:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much do you have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.07,0:16:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About 150k.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.09,0:16:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, those photon thingies are expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.33,0:17:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got 150k, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.73,0:17:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still need to get protective gear or\Nsome kind of weapon and the ammo for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.81,0:17:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's cheap but good?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.65,0:17:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll trust your judgment with all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.67,0:17:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For B.O.B., a live ammo\Nweapon's your best bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.69,0:17:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I'd go for\Naccuracy over stopping power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.03,0:17:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.43,0:17:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you'll spend most of your\Ncredits on it, but this one's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.65,0:17:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The FN-57.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.85,0:17:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's 5.7?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.57,0:17:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bullet caliber.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.17,0:17:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,5.7 millimeters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.43,0:17:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're smaller than the 9mm Parabellum\Nbullets, but they still pack a punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.25,0:17:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're similar in shape to rifle bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.79,0:17:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they've got the edge in both\Nprecision and stopping power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.63,0:17:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.33,0:17:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you even listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.69,0:17:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.60,0:17:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.63,0:17:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll buy that one then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.39,0:17:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that it, or do I need anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.21,0:17:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.73,0:18:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna need a holster, some\Nextra mags, some protective gear,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.63,0:18:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you should also get yourself\Na defense field and range time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.13,0:18:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.51,0:18:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never fired a gun before,\Nhave you? Uh-uh, never.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.83,0:18:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you buy a gun from the\Nshop, you can test it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.41,0:18:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know how to hold it? I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's lighter than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.93,0:18:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's cuz that models made of reinforced\Nplastic the recoil isn't too bad on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.45,0:18:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still you should grip it with both\Nhands and keep your left eye open.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.85,0:19:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So right now you should be seeing a\Ngreen circle in your field of vision?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.45,0:19:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it supposed to be shrinking\Nand expanding like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.33,0:19:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.24,0:19:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called the bullet circle,\Nyour offensive assist system.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.59,0:19:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your bullets will hit the target\Nat random inside the circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.65,0:19:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I boost my accuracy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.97,0:19:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess the easiest way is to get\Ncloser to your target. What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.19,0:19:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.25,0:19:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The faster your heart beats,\Nthe more the circle expands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.99,0:19:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is harder than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.79,0:19:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way! I missed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.33,0:19:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.61,0:19:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your first time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.47,0:20:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for going\Nout of your way for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.91,0:20:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate it. Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.13,0:20:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was happy to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.43,0:20:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There aren't many girl players here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.45,0:20:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't doing anything, so it was a good\Nway to kill some time before the prelims.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.85,0:20:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're going to compete in B .O .B.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.39,0:20:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.65,0:20:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was on my way to sign up before...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.91,0:20:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.15,0:20:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're closing soon. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.31,0:20:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.45,0:20:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my fault we're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.61,0:20:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's mine for not\Nkeeping track of the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.59,0:20:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever, let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.29,0:20:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're never gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.03,0:20:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't we just teleport over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.71,0:20:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.91,0:20:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That only happens when you respawn\Nat a revival point after you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.03,0:20:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we can't suicide ourselves to\Nget there either, because in town,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.67,0:20:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our HP never goes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.37,0:20:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The governor's office is at\Nleast three kilometers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.69,0:20:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna take us five minutes to sign\Nup, so we have to get there in three.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.79,0:20:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't close.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.37,0:21:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't close till we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.87,0:21:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.87,0:21:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.11,0:21:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.91,0:21:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.31,0:21:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are supposed to be\Nridiculously hard to drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.25,0:21:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know anyone who can\Nhandle them, so how come you can?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.19,0:21:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, I used to play a lot\Nof racing games back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.85,0:21:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.91,0:21:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.07,0:21:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.81,0:21:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on! Punch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.63,0:21:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The faster, the better!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.71,0:21:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.49,0:22:13.29,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I wished so hard to become stronger than ever
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.49,0:22:13.29,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k87\fad(200,200)}Mo{\k41}tto {\k48}tsu{\k23}yo{\k82}ku {\k34}sou {\k41}tsu{\k22}yo{\k87}ku {\k25}na{\k44}ri{\k25}ta{\k42}i {\k48}to {\k43}ne{\k46}ga{\k42}tta
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.29,0:22:17.21,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Overcoming my grief
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.29,0:22:17.21,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k26\fad(200,200)}Ka{\k18}na{\k26}shi{\k47}mi {\k20}wo {\k45}ko{\k45}e{\k165}te
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.42,0:22:27.97,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I've turned my back so many times
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.42,0:22:27.97,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k28\fad(200,200)}Ka{\k45}wa{\k22}ru {\k46}ko{\k44}to {\k42}nai {\k24}ka{\k23}ko {\k81}ni
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.97,0:22:31.60,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}On the past that will never change
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.97,0:22:31.60,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k33\fad(200,200)}Na{\k45}n{\k22}do {\k38}mo {\k51}se {\k42}wo {\k23}mu{\k21}ke{\k47}te{\k41}ta
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.60,0:22:38.98,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}While hiding the scars I can never show anyone
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.60,0:22:38.98,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k27\fad(200,200)}Da{\k44}re {\k22}ni {\k48}mo {\k42}mi{\k48}se{\k22}ra{\k19}re {\k47}nai {\k16}ki{\k30}zu {\k44}wo {\k21}ka{\k17}ku{\k51}shi{\k21}ta {\k26}ma{\k37}ma {\k49}zu{\k107}tto
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.05,0:22:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.98,0:22:46.11,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I will embrace all this pain that has started flooding through me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.98,0:22:46.11,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k23\fad(200,200)}A{\k30}fu{\k22}re {\k16}da{\k24}shi{\k24}ta {\k24}ko{\k22}no {\k23}i{\k24}ta{\k23}mi {\k99}wa {\k32}su{\k19}be{\k18}te {\k30}hi{\k23}to{\k21}ri {\k24}de {\k20}da{\k16}ki {\k30}shi{\k26}me{\k100}ru
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.11,0:22:49.07,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I don't need warmth at all
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.11,0:22:49.07,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k32\fad(200,200)}It{\k22}su{\k21}ka {\k24}ki{\k23}e{\k21}ru {\k22}nu{\k23}ku{\k26}mo{\k20}ri {\k22}na{\k40}ra
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.31,0:22:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not one thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.07,0:22:53.70,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}If it will vanish one day
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.07,0:22:53.70,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k24\fad(200,200)}Hi{\k21}to{\k26}tsu {\k46}mo {\k24}i{\k41}ra{\k44}nai {\k237}yo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.70,0:23:01.63,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I wished so hard to become stronger than ever
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.70,0:23:01.63,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k98\fad(200,200)}Mo{\k46}tto {\k44}tsu{\k23}yo{\k88}ku {\k29}sou {\k40}tsu{\k22}yo{\k91}ku {\k21}na{\k44}ri{\k25}ta{\k45}i {\k44}to {\k45}ne{\k44}ga{\k44}tta
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.39,0:22:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm stronger, stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.53,0:23:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to ask you to go to the dark.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.63,0:23:08.05,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Like a lonely star racing across the darkness
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.63,0:23:08.05,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k23\fad(200,200)}Ku{\k21}ra{\k21}ya{\k48}mi {\k22}wo {\k43}ka{\k48}ke{\k131}ru {\k26}ko{\k20}do{\k23}ku {\k43}na {\k21}ho{\k48}shi {\k20}no {\k25}you {\k59}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.99,0:23:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a lonely star,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.91,0:23:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm deep.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.05,0:23:15.81,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Sunk so deep inside my heart, I'm so weak and fragile
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.05,0:23:15.81,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k53\fad(200,200)}Ko{\k45}ko{\k44}ro {\k45}fu{\k22}ka{\k86}ku {\k30}shi{\k43}zu{\k22}me{\k89}ta {\k21}yo{\k44}wa{\k24}ku{\k44}te {\k46}mo{\k44}roi {\k25}ji{\k49}bun
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.81,0:23:22.90,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I can't put it into words, or even speak out
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.81,0:23:22.90,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k38\fad(200,200)}Ko{\k26}to{\k19}ba {\k46}ni {\k20}de{\k47}ki{\k32}na{\k11}ku{\k134}te {\k25}ko{\k25}e {\k18}ni {\k46}mo {\k21}na{\k46}ra{\k24}na{\k16}ku{\k115}te
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.90,0:23:27.94,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm just waiting for the light
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.90,0:23:27.94,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k68\fad(200,200)}Ki{\k22}tto {\k34}da{\k31}re {\k26}ni {\k30}mo {\k35}mi{\k23}tsu{\k39}ka{\k29}ra {\k23}na{\k34}i {\k32}yo{\k24}u {\k54}ni
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.94,0:23:33.66,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,400)}Trying not to be found by anyone
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.94,0:23:33.66,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k34\fad(200,400)}Ta{\k64}da {\k17}hik{\k56}ari {\k26}wo {\k42}ma{\k20}tte{\k313}ru
